# Bolg of the North: "When Bolg enters, you may sacrifice another creature. When you do, Bolg deals damage equal to that creature's
# power to another target creature. If excess damage was dealt this way, amass Goblins X, where X is that excess damage." With the
# ability on the stack Bot1 gives its Alpine Grizzly (4/2) +3/+3 with Giant Growth, then sacrifices it: its power as it last existed
# is 7, so Bolg deals 7 to Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2), 5 more than lethal, and Bot1 amasses Goblins 5: a 5/5 Goblin Army token.
# Bolg himself is no legal target (refused) while Bot2's Ornithopter and Bears are.

